# "neste" and "nesta" read as "este" and "esta" before a part of the day or a
# period ("nesta mañá", "nesta semana"), but not before a weekday.  "este
# luns" picks the Monday of the current week, which can be past, while the
# next occurrence is the right answer (a weekday said alone reads forward).
# "neste luns" keeps the reading of the bare weekday.
neste
nesta
